title: "Lorena Sparse Contrast Representation Benchmark"
authors:
  - family-names: Agnihotri
    given-names: Shashank
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-08
repository-code: "https://github.com/shashankskagnihotri/Lorena_Contrastive_Representation_Arch"
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch MNIST and CIFAR-10 study of fixed signed contrast
  representations, coefficient sparsification, compact ViT and Swin execution,
  clean classification, corruption robustness, and measured online latency.
  The repository reports negative results and explicitly incomplete timing coverage.
